WEBVTT

01:50.009 --> 01:53.940
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.270 --> 01:56.729
[Episode 18]

02:14.710 --> 02:15.450
Two bowls of wontons, please.

02:15.450 --> 02:15.840
Okay.

02:15.870 --> 02:17.130
Sit wherever you like.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.430
Auntie Li, long time no see!

02:18.430 --> 02:19.870
Here to see your best friend again?

02:19.870 --> 02:21.590
She's been waiting here for a while.

02:21.590 --> 02:23.000
She just went to the restroom.

02:23.000 --> 02:23.680
I know.

02:23.680 --> 02:24.680
She said she already bought everything.

02:24.680 --> 02:25.240
Go ahead and sit.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.560
What would you like to order?

02:26.560 --> 02:27.680
Two pan-fried buns, please.

02:27.680 --> 02:28.680
Okay, no problem.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.490
Why did she get so much takeout?

02:33.550 --> 02:35.040
I'm starving.

02:43.150 --> 02:44.120
This is for you.

02:46.590 --> 02:47.079
Okay.

02:51.400 --> 02:52.860
Sorry, this seat is taken.

02:55.570 --> 02:56.150
It's okay.

02:56.150 --> 02:58.270
You can sit here for a bit if you like.

03:17.940 --> 03:19.620
These are our local zongzi.

03:20.100 --> 03:20.750
Thank you.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.220
Guangming?

03:28.470 --> 03:29.130
Guangming!

03:30.310 --> 03:32.350
Weren't you supposed to get me wontons?

03:32.350 --> 03:33.540
What's going on here?

03:33.540 --> 03:35.420
And where are my super-famous
pan-fried buns from Xiyuan?

03:34.500 --> 03:35.530
[I just went to the restroom and hung
the pan-fried buns on the shop's door.]

03:35.440 --> 03:36.000
Where are they?

03:35.530 --> 03:36.570
[Those are the super-famous pan-fried buns
from Xiyuan. Remember to grab them.]

03:36.190 --> 03:37.650
Right there, aren't they?

03:44.150 --> 03:45.000
I'm sorry.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.310
I'll transfer the money to you.

03:46.310 --> 03:46.960
No need.

03:47.079 --> 03:47.590
Okay.

03:49.750 --> 03:50.480
Next time...

03:50.750 --> 03:52.280
Next time, you can treat me.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.400
Honey...

04:12.840 --> 04:13.770
Sorry, I'm late.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.280
Not too early, not too late—

04:15.280 --> 04:16.339
just right on time.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.100
You two haven't been here
in a long time, right?

04:18.100 --> 04:18.899
It's my fault.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.829
I've been too busy with work lately.

04:20.829 --> 04:22.350
It's good for young people to stay busy.

04:22.350 --> 04:23.280
Enjoy your meal.

04:27.560 --> 04:28.120
Honey,

04:28.720 --> 04:31.250
I'll have plenty of time
to spend with you now.

04:31.310 --> 04:32.510
I've completed
all the resignation procedures

04:32.510 --> 04:33.430
at Longyuan,

04:33.490 --> 04:35.890
and the new project
has been confirmed too.

04:39.750 --> 04:40.950
Then we really should

04:41.680 --> 04:43.190
thank Chi Xin properly.

05:10.710 --> 05:13.640
You already know about my cooperation
with Zhiteng?

05:15.750 --> 05:16.880
I was planning to...

05:17.830 --> 05:19.690
tell you about it when we got home.

05:19.750 --> 05:21.610
After the last exchange meeting,

05:22.120 --> 05:23.800
Zhiteng approached me for cooperation,

05:23.800 --> 05:26.660
and Chi Xin is the person
in charge of coordination.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.040
Why don't we

05:30.040 --> 05:32.170
invite Chi Xin for a meal sometime soon?

05:32.170 --> 05:34.770
To avoid any misunderstandings
in the future.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.730
I've already met her.

05:43.870 --> 05:46.040
At the park near the Zhiteng building.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.390
Honey.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.430
Listen to me...

06:05.510 --> 06:07.770
Chi Xin and I are strictly professional.

06:07.870 --> 06:09.240
We're work partners.

06:10.310 --> 06:11.140
We only get together

06:11.140 --> 06:12.670
to discuss the project.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.390
I have no feelings for her whatsoever

06:15.390 --> 06:17.190
and never will.

06:37.120 --> 06:37.920
Yes.

06:41.159 --> 06:42.760
She tried to make a move on me.

06:43.630 --> 06:44.630
But I refused.

06:45.080 --> 06:46.590
I deflected all of it.

06:47.750 --> 06:49.240
She's my client.

06:49.480 --> 06:50.510
She has her projects,

06:50.510 --> 06:51.750
and I have my company.

06:52.030 --> 06:54.090
I can't just ignore my company and...

07:06.480 --> 07:07.310
I was wrong.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.870
I'm also very tired.

07:12.430 --> 07:14.040
Can we talk about this at home...

07:14.040 --> 07:15.480
Stop talking!

07:21.040 --> 07:21.970
Wang Guangming.

07:23.210 --> 07:25.010
Every word you're saying now...

07:28.510 --> 07:30.270
is destroying our past.

07:37.510 --> 07:38.720
Let's just stop here.

07:48.159 --> 07:48.800
Well,

07:49.680 --> 07:51.200
I'll give you three days.

07:53.390 --> 07:55.190
Pack up your things and move out.

08:04.200 --> 08:05.200
This meal is on me.

08:57.870 --> 08:58.670
Zhao?

08:59.920 --> 09:01.520
Why are you sitting out here?

09:02.150 --> 09:03.480
Why don't you go inside?

09:04.480 --> 09:05.360
Did you forget?

09:05.790 --> 09:06.960
When your boss rented your loft before,

09:06.960 --> 09:08.420
I returned the keys to you.

09:10.060 --> 09:11.660
I'll give them to you in a bit.

09:13.030 --> 09:13.750
Help me up.

09:14.030 --> 09:15.290
My feet have gone numb.

09:19.510 --> 09:20.510
Are you okay?

09:22.440 --> 09:23.670
I'm fine.

09:24.000 --> 09:24.750
Don't worry.

09:25.470 --> 09:27.730
But you'll have to
put me up for a few days.

09:44.790 --> 09:45.320
Mr. Pei.

09:45.550 --> 09:46.080
Come in.

09:48.120 --> 09:49.380
The financial report.

09:50.390 --> 09:51.920
Have a seat, Director Shen.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.950
You've been quite busy lately.

09:55.950 --> 09:57.410
I haven't seen you around.

10:00.150 --> 10:01.960
During the year-end settlement,

10:01.960 --> 10:03.850
some accounts weren't verified in time.

10:03.850 --> 10:04.690
I've been busy with that

10:04.690 --> 10:05.690
the past few days.

10:06.430 --> 10:07.870
The financial report
was delayed by a few days.

10:07.870 --> 10:09.390
Sorry for causing you
some concern, Mr. Pei.

10:09.390 --> 10:10.200
It's fine.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.510
I'm on good terms with Mr. Xie.

10:11.510 --> 10:13.530
A quick word with him will sort it out.

10:13.530 --> 10:14.130
By the way,

10:14.720 --> 10:16.230
I heard from Wu Bin

10:16.330 --> 10:18.710
that you rear-ended someone the other day.

10:18.710 --> 10:20.490
You're not usually so careless.

10:20.490 --> 10:21.350
What happened?

10:26.440 --> 10:27.120
That day...

10:27.630 --> 10:30.060
I was in a hurry to pick up my son
from kindergarten.

10:30.060 --> 10:31.860
I just wasn't paying attention.

10:40.940 --> 10:41.570
Mr. Pei,

10:42.030 --> 10:43.480
if there's nothing else,

10:43.560 --> 10:44.760
I'll get back to work.

10:48.390 --> 10:49.450
Give me your phone.

11:06.420 --> 11:07.950
Your son is quite adorable.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.860
He looks a lot like you.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.840
If there's financial fraud,

11:16.960 --> 11:18.360
the first one

11:18.610 --> 11:21.610
they'll investigate is you—
the Financial Director.

11:22.550 --> 11:23.960
Do you want your son

11:23.960 --> 11:26.080
to grow up with a father in prison?

11:33.480 --> 11:34.910
That day, outside my father's office,

11:34.910 --> 11:36.120
when I saw you leaving,

11:36.120 --> 11:37.980
I already felt something was off.

11:38.090 --> 11:39.540
So I had Wu Bin follow you.

11:40.600 --> 11:43.660
On top of that, you kept delaying
the financial report.

11:44.510 --> 11:45.640
What's the problem?

11:46.200 --> 11:46.910
Tell me.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.240
Director Shen,

11:54.230 --> 11:57.760
there's no need to hide things
between you and my father from me.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.720
After all, I'm a Pei too.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.930
It was all the Chairman's idea.

12:10.560 --> 12:11.700
The company's revenue

12:11.700 --> 12:14.360
hasn't been great
over the past couple of years.

12:14.460 --> 12:15.940
I had no choice.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.720
What exactly is going on?

12:21.630 --> 12:23.030
Explain it to me clearly.

12:49.390 --> 12:49.960
Come in.

13:02.200 --> 13:03.240
How long were you

13:04.440 --> 13:06.700
planning to hide the financials from me?

13:07.670 --> 13:08.870
I just found out today

13:09.030 --> 13:10.430
that the company has been

13:10.430 --> 13:12.270
artificially inflating net profits
and fabricating transactions

13:12.270 --> 13:13.390
for the past few years.

13:13.390 --> 13:15.440
Shen Jie has been scrambling
to pull funds from outside sources

13:15.440 --> 13:16.790
to cover the shortfall on the books.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.270
Dad.

13:18.270 --> 13:18.870
If profits are declining,

13:18.870 --> 13:20.400
I can figure something out.

13:20.510 --> 13:22.110
I can start some new projects

13:22.510 --> 13:23.910
or transfer some assets.

13:24.940 --> 13:26.570
But why take such a big risk?

13:27.080 --> 13:28.360
Financial fraud

13:29.080 --> 13:30.320
is illegal.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.030
In business,

13:35.480 --> 13:38.340
people only help those
who are already successful;

13:38.360 --> 13:39.820
no one helps those in need.

13:40.120 --> 13:41.270
Only when a company shows good profits

13:41.270 --> 13:42.790
can it secure more loans,

13:43.150 --> 13:45.840
and only then can it have
more opportunities to make money.

13:45.840 --> 13:48.480
So that's why you had someone doctor
the financial reports,

13:48.480 --> 13:51.680
hoping to turn losses into profits
with Lyman's project?

13:51.750 --> 13:53.880
We must proceed with Lyman's project.

13:55.530 --> 13:57.930
As long as the payments
come back smoothly,

13:58.150 --> 13:59.790
other risks are negligible.

14:01.450 --> 14:02.980
But once this is discovered

14:03.270 --> 14:04.550
and people start digging,

14:04.550 --> 14:06.790
can the company really withstand
an investigation?

14:06.790 --> 14:08.870
Whether it's fines or prison sentences,

14:08.870 --> 14:11.530
Forma's reputation
will be completely ruined!

14:17.800 --> 14:18.860
All these years...

14:20.590 --> 14:21.340
All these years,

14:21.340 --> 14:22.740
I've put my heart and soul

14:23.200 --> 14:25.240
into keeping Forma standing.

14:26.240 --> 14:26.870
And you?

14:27.750 --> 14:29.210
From the day you were born,

14:29.510 --> 14:31.310
you've only climbed a few steps,

14:31.440 --> 14:32.470
yet you're standing
at the top of the building,

14:32.470 --> 14:34.070
looking down on everything.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.860
Remember this:

14:38.480 --> 14:40.630
I paved those steps for you.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.450
And you've already walked halfway up.

14:44.120 --> 14:46.320
If the building ever collapses,

14:46.910 --> 14:48.390
you won't escape either.

14:53.970 --> 14:55.430
You should understand...

14:56.560 --> 14:57.760
what needs to be done.

15:17.960 --> 15:18.750
Ms. Hu!

15:19.150 --> 15:19.670
I was just talking with Mr. Pei...

15:19.670 --> 15:20.480
Sorry.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.550
I think I left my phone
at the reception desk.

15:22.550 --> 15:23.840
Could you help me check?

15:23.840 --> 15:25.700
No problem. Please wait a moment.

15:36.690 --> 15:37.290
Mr. Pei,

15:37.670 --> 15:40.600
I'm here to pick up
the latest supplier information.

15:54.550 --> 15:56.010
Sorry to keep you waiting.

16:22.460 --> 16:23.190
Ms. Hu.

16:30.960 --> 16:31.750
Tell me,

16:33.210 --> 16:35.470
if the foundation has already been laid,

16:35.720 --> 16:36.440
does that mean construction

16:36.440 --> 16:38.770
can only follow the original blueprints,

16:39.190 --> 16:40.920
with no possibility of change?

16:44.600 --> 16:45.910
The foundation does determine

16:45.910 --> 16:48.110
a building's structure and direction.

16:51.720 --> 16:53.980
It's the basis of everything, after all.

16:54.600 --> 16:56.060
It's difficult to change.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.410
But it's not absolute.

17:00.550 --> 17:02.610
Even if the foundation is completed,

17:02.800 --> 17:05.460
as long as the load distribution
isn't altered,

17:05.480 --> 17:06.349
you can modify

17:06.349 --> 17:08.210
the building's exterior design.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.660
During construction,

17:09.829 --> 17:13.030
if there are any new building technologies
or standards,

17:13.030 --> 17:15.030
as long as they don't compromise
structural safety,

17:15.030 --> 17:16.270
changes can be made.

17:21.240 --> 17:21.880
Mr. Pei,

17:22.829 --> 17:26.089
so what ultimately decides
a building's final appearance

17:26.240 --> 17:27.500
isn't the foundation,

17:28.310 --> 17:29.400
but your vision.

17:35.500 --> 17:37.940
I'll take these materials
back to the studio first.

17:37.940 --> 17:38.580
Goodbye.

17:57.030 --> 17:57.560
Mr. Xiao,

17:57.880 --> 18:00.070
here's the latest supplier information
from Forma.

18:00.070 --> 18:01.720
I guarantee nothing is missing.

18:01.720 --> 18:03.350
Why are you the one delivering this?

18:03.350 --> 18:04.720
Hu Xiu asked me to bring it over.

18:04.720 --> 18:05.790
She said she had nothing to report,

18:05.790 --> 18:06.850
so she didn't come.

18:08.720 --> 18:09.450
Where is she?

18:09.550 --> 18:10.410
She's off work.

18:10.480 --> 18:12.550
She mentioned
her friend has a lot going on lately,

18:12.550 --> 18:14.750
so she's going to help out this weekend.

18:30.310 --> 18:32.110
Wang Guangming,
it's already been three days.

18:32.110 --> 18:32.880
Come back quickly,

18:32.880 --> 18:34.610
pack your things, and move out.

18:48.030 --> 18:48.640
Xiaorou,

18:48.810 --> 18:50.230
Guangming has gastric bleeding
and is in the hospital.

18:50.230 --> 18:51.560
You should go there now.

19:12.490 --> 19:13.620
We're the same—

19:14.400 --> 19:16.400
when something weighs on our minds,

19:16.400 --> 19:18.550
we keep ourselves busy like spinning tops,

19:18.550 --> 19:19.480
never stopping.

19:22.550 --> 19:23.480
But...

19:24.430 --> 19:26.090
don't push your body too hard.

19:27.750 --> 19:28.440
I'm not.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.640
They're pressing
for the final installment.

19:32.640 --> 19:34.700
I want to finish this project quickly

19:35.070 --> 19:37.000
so I can pay the final installment.

19:39.200 --> 19:40.110
That way...

19:42.480 --> 19:43.640
maybe you'll stay.

19:44.310 --> 19:45.240
Wang Guangming.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.840
Now, when you speak,

19:48.040 --> 19:50.170
I find myself instinctively weighing

19:50.540 --> 19:52.070
how sincere you really are.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.070
Not just now,

19:55.270 --> 19:56.590
but all those beautiful moments

19:56.590 --> 19:58.200
we shared before—

19:59.600 --> 20:01.530
I feel confused about everything.

20:04.990 --> 20:07.030
Do you remember our first date?

20:08.480 --> 20:10.340
On that street behind the school.

20:10.980 --> 20:13.310
That's when you held my hand
for the first time.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.400
At that time, we were both

20:14.400 --> 20:16.350
so nervous our palms were sweaty,

20:16.830 --> 20:18.960
and we smiled foolishly at each other.

20:19.200 --> 20:20.110
I think

20:21.320 --> 20:23.850
at least then, you were sincere,
weren't you?

20:25.510 --> 20:26.400
Back then,

20:27.360 --> 20:28.680
my school was far away.

20:29.400 --> 20:30.240
Whenever you had time,

20:30.240 --> 20:32.700
you'd take the subway
over 20 stops to see me.

20:33.200 --> 20:35.930
You'd bring lots of delicious food
from downtown

20:36.590 --> 20:37.640
and tell me

20:37.640 --> 20:39.030
that even if I grew to 200 pounds,

20:39.030 --> 20:40.560
you would never abandon me.

20:41.000 --> 20:41.750
I think

20:42.830 --> 20:44.880
at least then, you were sincere.

20:47.160 --> 20:48.190
Near graduation,

20:48.600 --> 20:49.740
I got sick and was hospitalized.

20:49.740 --> 20:51.440
I didn't dare tell my parents about it.

20:51.440 --> 20:52.750
At the time, Hu Xiu was

20:52.820 --> 20:55.080
overwhelmed with her father's surgery.

20:55.160 --> 20:58.760
You were the one who stayed up
night after night to take care of me.

20:58.920 --> 20:59.720
I think

21:00.070 --> 21:02.270
at least then, you were sincere with me.

21:05.050 --> 21:06.860
So, when did you stop

21:08.160 --> 21:09.480
being sincere?

21:11.310 --> 21:12.680
At the class reunion,

21:13.240 --> 21:15.640
when everyone praised us
as a model couple,

21:15.920 --> 21:17.720
were you genuinely happy,

21:18.400 --> 21:22.330
or were you thinking about the person
you were going to meet afterward?

21:23.300 --> 21:25.880
When you gave me some freebie
as our anniversary gift,

21:25.880 --> 21:27.810
were you trying to get away with it,

21:27.840 --> 21:29.440
or did you truly just forget?

21:30.230 --> 21:31.880
Did you ever feel any regret?

21:34.880 --> 21:36.830
I keep thinking about
all the kind things you did for me,

21:36.830 --> 21:39.430
all while being tormented
by those questions.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.030
Xiaorou.

21:44.010 --> 21:45.340
I can swear to you—

21:45.830 --> 21:46.680
nothing ever happened

21:46.680 --> 21:47.200
between Chi Xin and me,

21:47.200 --> 21:48.460
except for that one kiss.

21:48.460 --> 21:49.790
I pushed her away that day.

21:49.790 --> 21:50.400
I went to explain to her...

21:50.400 --> 21:52.880
Do you know why I'm telling you all this?

21:55.960 --> 21:58.030
Because our past was too beautiful.

21:59.820 --> 22:01.720
I really can't accept any impurities

22:01.720 --> 22:03.200
in our relationship.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.000
You don't need to tell me

22:07.000 --> 22:08.680
how far things went between you two,

22:08.680 --> 22:09.680
what things are like now,

22:09.680 --> 22:11.540
or what will happen in the future.

22:11.590 --> 22:13.720
People who keep asking those questions

22:13.720 --> 22:15.980
are just looking for reasons to forgive.

22:16.930 --> 22:17.970
But I'm not.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.610
Wang Guangming,

22:24.500 --> 22:25.740
let's both move on.

22:31.360 --> 22:32.160
Xiaorou...

22:34.580 --> 22:36.100
But I still love you.

22:37.440 --> 22:38.960
I can't move on.

22:39.440 --> 22:41.300
We have so much history together,

22:42.110 --> 22:44.370
yet you can let it all go
in just a few days?

22:44.590 --> 22:45.720
I haven't let go.

22:47.440 --> 22:49.370
But it doesn't matter if I haven't.

22:51.000 --> 22:52.800
I've decided to stop loving you,

22:53.120 --> 22:54.850
so you've become nothing to me.

23:00.310 --> 23:01.570
Take care of yourself.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.640
Drawing on Souler's ideas,

24:05.640 --> 24:06.790
I've created a new dessert.

24:06.790 --> 24:08.720
I'm planning to call it "Rebirth."

24:08.880 --> 24:10.810
Any dessert buddies want to try it?

24:11.350 --> 24:13.350
I think this name was my suggestion.

24:13.480 --> 24:14.750
Glad I could help.

24:19.310 --> 24:22.440
Congratulations on breaking through
your creative block. Keep it up!

24:22.440 --> 24:23.960
I've also opened a coffee shop.

24:23.960 --> 24:25.750
We should exchange ideas sometime.

24:25.750 --> 24:26.640
"Rebirth?"

24:26.830 --> 24:28.270
I guess the name reflects you perfectly.

24:28.270 --> 24:30.800
Congratulations on finding yourself again.

24:30.960 --> 24:32.220
Mr. Gong, you're here.

24:33.000 --> 24:35.330
What are you looking at?
You look so happy.

24:35.590 --> 24:36.880
I just made a new special,

24:36.880 --> 24:39.080
and I'm checking everyone's feedback.

24:41.350 --> 24:42.950
The feedback is pretty good.

24:44.460 --> 24:46.980
By the way, are those pipes fixed now?

24:48.110 --> 24:49.640
All replaced with new ones.

24:50.170 --> 24:50.660
Good.

24:51.830 --> 24:53.880
Want to try the new drink?

24:53.880 --> 24:54.880
It's on the house.

24:55.000 --> 24:56.030
Cocktail coffee.

24:57.790 --> 25:00.240
People usually have coffee in the morning
and alcohol at night,

25:00.240 --> 25:01.590
but yours is two in one.

25:01.910 --> 25:03.460
Alright, I've got to try it.

25:08.000 --> 25:09.590
Making new specials

25:09.590 --> 25:11.390
and setting up collaborations—

25:11.440 --> 25:13.370
you're quite efficient, Ms. Zhao.

25:14.310 --> 25:15.270
I have no choice.

25:15.590 --> 25:17.520
The café scene in Shanghai
is too competitive.

25:17.520 --> 25:19.580
If I want to build brand recognition,

25:19.680 --> 25:21.880
I need to come up with something new.

25:23.000 --> 25:23.830
This was

25:24.260 --> 25:25.390
just an appetizer.

25:31.490 --> 25:32.820
This is the main course.

25:33.600 --> 25:36.860
[ME Murder Mystery Game Shop & Regard Café
Collab Event Proposal]

25:34.840 --> 25:35.900
A collab event?

25:37.960 --> 25:38.960
Earlier,

25:39.030 --> 25:41.660
I was chatting with people
at the Virtual Party on this app

25:41.660 --> 25:42.940
and got inspired.

25:43.310 --> 25:45.830
I think
our two businesses could collaborate.

25:45.830 --> 25:46.640
I could

25:46.690 --> 25:49.820
design coffee drinks inspired
by murder mystery games.

25:49.830 --> 25:51.440
After players finish their games,

25:51.440 --> 25:52.400
they can come

25:52.400 --> 25:52.750
to my Regard Café with their ticket stubs

25:52.750 --> 25:53.950
and try them for free.

25:54.110 --> 25:54.680
We can also

25:54.680 --> 25:55.110
organize offline events

25:55.110 --> 25:56.440
at Regard,

25:57.160 --> 25:59.510
regularly hosting gatherings
for those players.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.440
That way, the storylines

26:00.440 --> 26:02.400
from the murder mystery games
could extend into

26:02.400 --> 26:03.920
many new side stories,

26:04.160 --> 26:06.480
which could even turn into
limited-edition board games.

26:06.480 --> 26:07.480
I believe

26:07.680 --> 26:08.790
if this catches on,

26:08.790 --> 26:09.910
your club

26:10.000 --> 26:12.400
will definitely attract many new players.

26:12.730 --> 26:13.420
What?

26:13.830 --> 26:15.680
You think I'm just trying to
ride on your club's popularity?

26:15.680 --> 26:16.280
No.

26:16.550 --> 26:17.160
Not at all.

26:17.640 --> 26:18.500
It sounds good.

26:18.710 --> 26:20.310
I'll go back and look into it.

26:21.590 --> 26:22.590
I didn't expect

26:23.030 --> 26:24.110
you'd be like

26:25.240 --> 26:27.500
a different person after just a few days.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.190
[Divorce Agreement]

26:34.810 --> 26:36.090
Sorry, wrong file.

26:45.000 --> 26:47.260
What do you think of Ms. Zhao's proposal?

26:47.640 --> 26:49.750
I think it's good. Worth collaborating on.

26:49.750 --> 26:50.950
You came all the way to my place

26:50.950 --> 26:52.280
just to talk about this?

26:53.160 --> 26:54.510
You invested money,

26:54.640 --> 26:56.970
so of course, I needed to
ask your opinion.

26:57.160 --> 26:58.820
Do whatever you think is best.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.400
You have no objections?

27:04.720 --> 27:06.520
This trip was unnecessary then.

27:12.920 --> 27:13.640
Xiao,

27:14.110 --> 27:15.070
are you on a hunger strike?

27:15.070 --> 27:17.000
You don't even have any water
in your fridge.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.060
Forgot to buy some.

27:20.510 --> 27:22.440
Well, this is a pleasant surprise.

27:28.440 --> 27:29.680
You guys—none of you

27:30.110 --> 27:31.060
are normal.

27:32.880 --> 27:34.480
One's practicing asceticism,

27:34.480 --> 27:35.880
not even drinking water,

27:36.200 --> 27:37.790
and barely answers when you talk to him.

27:37.790 --> 27:38.990
The other one seems to

27:39.510 --> 27:40.790
have a split personality.

27:40.790 --> 27:42.720
A few days ago, she was acting
as if she were possessed,

27:42.720 --> 27:45.180
but now she's hyper,
like she's on steroids.

27:45.270 --> 27:46.470
And there's one more—

27:46.590 --> 27:47.590
a violent maniac,

27:47.750 --> 27:51.210
venting all her anger
through murder mystery games every day.

27:51.890 --> 27:52.820
Violent maniac?

27:54.950 --> 27:56.410
Will you cover this for me?

28:01.590 --> 28:02.440
I mean Hu Xiu.

28:02.690 --> 28:03.970
She has been spending the whole weekend

28:03.970 --> 28:05.700
playing murder mystery games.

28:06.290 --> 28:07.350
What's up with her?

28:11.260 --> 28:12.920
She's gone on a killing spree.

28:14.480 --> 28:15.550
Literally.

28:17.310 --> 28:18.350
Qin Xiaoyi,

28:19.150 --> 28:20.350
you're under arrest.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.720
Take him away.

28:24.030 --> 28:24.470
Move.

28:25.030 --> 28:25.690
Xu Xiuzhen,

28:25.900 --> 28:27.480
I have no grievances with you.

28:27.480 --> 28:29.010
Why are you doing this to me?

28:29.030 --> 28:30.160
-Move!
-Xu Xiuzhen!

28:33.720 --> 28:34.450
Chen Xuemei,

28:34.480 --> 28:35.270
calm down!

28:35.660 --> 28:37.920
Hold on, let's talk this through calmly!

28:42.590 --> 28:43.460
Let's talk...

29:10.480 --> 29:11.110
Wait.

29:12.880 --> 29:15.280
Why is it always Qin Xiaoyi
who ends up dead?

29:16.270 --> 29:19.000
Li Yue has had it pretty rough
these past two days.

29:24.030 --> 29:25.690
Let's take a break, everyone.

29:26.030 --> 29:26.440
Okay.

29:32.610 --> 29:33.350
I have a massage gun at home.

29:33.350 --> 29:34.700
I'll bring it for you tomorrow?

29:34.700 --> 29:35.740
Don't bother.

29:35.760 --> 29:37.690
I'll just do some stretches later.

30:06.350 --> 30:07.810
I heard from Gong Huaicong

30:08.370 --> 30:12.370
that you've been going to his club a lot
for murder mystery games lately.

30:18.030 --> 30:20.430
Is it really necessary
to go there so often?

30:22.790 --> 30:24.200
What's wrong with that?

30:27.200 --> 30:28.200
Aren't you tired?

30:30.680 --> 30:32.540
There's been a lot of work lately.

30:32.770 --> 30:33.690
Don't waste your energy

30:33.690 --> 30:35.820
and neglect what's really important.

30:37.880 --> 30:38.590
Mr. Xiao,

30:38.960 --> 30:41.170
may I ask what important matters
I have neglected?

30:41.170 --> 30:42.630
I've completed
the technical disclosure work

30:42.630 --> 30:43.780
with Forma.

30:44.110 --> 30:46.200
From design concepts
to construction points,

30:46.200 --> 30:47.640
and addressing the contractors' questions
about the drawings—

30:47.640 --> 30:49.700
I've explained everything clearly.

30:50.400 --> 30:52.270
I've also finished
the construction progress plan

30:52.270 --> 30:53.790
and submitted it
to Ms. Zhou for confirmation.

30:53.790 --> 30:55.030
And I've already collected
Forma's supplier information

30:55.030 --> 30:56.590
and given it to you.

30:57.800 --> 31:01.110
I've also followed up with Lyman
about their financial report.

31:01.110 --> 31:03.000
Mr. Xiao, may I ask—
since I've completed all the work,

31:03.000 --> 31:04.530
what exactly is my problem?

31:11.790 --> 31:12.320
Nothing.

31:13.790 --> 31:15.000
Then please, Mr. Xiao,

31:15.000 --> 31:16.680
don't overly concern yourself

31:16.680 --> 31:19.010
with employees' personal arrangements.

31:27.310 --> 31:29.440
What was I even doing?

31:32.300 --> 31:33.900
I can't afford to offend him,

31:34.490 --> 31:36.020
but at least I can avoid him.

31:52.590 --> 31:53.400
Zhao,

31:54.030 --> 31:56.690
you've been coming home
later and later lately.

31:59.590 --> 32:01.160
After finishing work at the café

32:01.160 --> 32:02.590
and having meetings with Gong Huaicong,

32:02.590 --> 32:04.720
it's already 11 PM before I realize it.

32:07.160 --> 32:07.760
Oh, right.

32:10.550 --> 32:11.200
Here.

32:12.320 --> 32:12.840
[Free Pass]

32:14.240 --> 32:16.030
If I'd known I could get free passes,

32:16.030 --> 32:17.310
I should've

32:17.440 --> 32:18.240
gotten you to collaborate

32:18.240 --> 32:19.440
with Mr. Gong sooner.

32:20.120 --> 32:22.640
Your ulterior motives are so obvious.

32:23.660 --> 32:25.070
Gong Huaicong has been giving me

32:25.070 --> 32:26.240
all the fill-in tickets these days,

32:26.240 --> 32:27.400
and those still aren't enough for you?

32:27.400 --> 32:28.440
Enough, really.

32:28.590 --> 32:29.790
It's all thanks to you

32:29.790 --> 32:32.030
that I got to play so many free games.

32:32.030 --> 32:33.110
Remember that.

32:35.290 --> 32:37.050
There's a delivery for you.

32:37.720 --> 32:38.350
To you.

32:51.530 --> 32:52.490
[Divorce Agreement]

33:08.790 --> 33:09.550
Zhao...

33:10.470 --> 33:12.880
What are your plans going forward?

33:17.950 --> 33:19.000
The Regard Café account

33:19.000 --> 33:20.930
has reached over 2,000 followers.

33:21.120 --> 33:21.850
I'm planning

33:22.010 --> 33:24.410
to get the collab event started
right away.

33:24.920 --> 33:26.850
Who knows, maybe it'll hit 10,000.

33:44.240 --> 33:45.680
You all know about

33:45.680 --> 33:46.830
our two stores collaborating, right?

33:46.830 --> 33:49.230
I've developed several new coffee drinks.

33:49.310 --> 33:50.440
Their names and flavors

33:50.440 --> 33:52.970
are all inspired
by the murder mystery games.

33:53.030 --> 33:53.480
Later,

33:53.480 --> 33:54.720
they'll be available at Rongcheng Café

33:54.720 --> 33:56.400
and my café simultaneously.

33:56.590 --> 33:58.240
I invited you all here today

33:58.240 --> 34:00.720
so you can sample our new products
in advance

34:00.720 --> 34:02.180
and give me some feedback.

34:02.830 --> 34:04.350
Let me introduce them to you.

34:04.350 --> 34:06.070
This latte with ice cream

34:06.070 --> 34:07.640
is called "Rongcheng Snowy Night."

34:07.640 --> 34:08.920
What's the name of

34:09.070 --> 34:09.800
this milk pudding coffee?

34:09.800 --> 34:10.760
"Bits of Silver."

34:10.760 --> 34:11.840
Xiu came up with the name.

34:11.840 --> 34:13.550
This basic milk coffee

34:13.550 --> 34:14.989
is called "Perfect Partners."

34:14.989 --> 34:17.120
Ms. Zhao, how's the discussion going?

34:18.150 --> 34:20.080
Why did you two come here together?

34:21.370 --> 34:23.070
Didn't you say you wouldn't
get involved in the collaboration?

34:23.070 --> 34:24.440
Why the sudden change of heart?

34:24.440 --> 34:26.440
Your intentions are crystal clear.

34:26.670 --> 34:28.030
I'm here to discuss

34:28.030 --> 34:29.239
the specific details with Ms. Zhao.

34:29.239 --> 34:31.460
We still have two hours
before the evening session anyway,

34:31.460 --> 34:32.400
so there's no rush to go back.

34:32.400 --> 34:33.360
Let's treat this as a get-together

34:33.360 --> 34:34.150
and chat for a while.

34:34.150 --> 34:34.590
Okay.

34:35.400 --> 34:36.510
Come on, sit with us.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.909
Zhiyu, sit here, come on.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.070
Hello,

34:49.150 --> 34:49.989
excuse me.

34:50.010 --> 34:51.870
Which lady are these flowers for?

34:54.840 --> 34:55.550
Not for me.

34:55.570 --> 34:57.100
I just became single again.

35:02.140 --> 35:04.400
I-Isn't there a name written on the card?

35:04.480 --> 35:05.340
There is a name.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.280
It says...

35:07.920 --> 35:08.720
"Baby."

35:12.480 --> 35:13.740
I'll make a call to ask.

35:31.400 --> 35:32.800
My boyfriend and I

35:33.150 --> 35:34.630
have been dating for less than a week.

35:34.630 --> 35:37.000
We didn't expect these flowers
to be for you.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.460
After all, weren't you...

35:40.230 --> 35:42.590
I did have a crush on Zhiyu before.

35:42.760 --> 35:44.110
I thought Qin Xiaoyi was handsome,

35:44.110 --> 35:45.840
so I couldn't separate the character
from the person playing him.

35:45.840 --> 35:46.880
It's fine to get immersed,

35:46.880 --> 35:48.680
but sooner or later, you wake up.

35:49.190 --> 35:51.240
Ms. Hu, you must understand what I mean.

35:51.240 --> 35:52.620
You've played so many sessions before.

35:52.620 --> 35:53.350
Wasn't it

35:53.510 --> 35:54.970
all because of Qin Xiaoyi?

35:56.960 --> 35:58.280
No, no, I...

35:58.550 --> 35:59.710
I like him...

36:00.800 --> 36:02.530
Qin Xiaoyi's character setup.

36:03.630 --> 36:05.110
Actually, after playing so many sessions,

36:05.110 --> 36:08.110
I think either of them
could play the role just as well.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.510
True.

36:09.670 --> 36:10.630
Xiu, haven't you been playing
in the sessions

36:10.630 --> 36:12.510
where Li Yue plays the role lately?

36:12.510 --> 36:13.110
Zhiyu,

36:13.440 --> 36:16.550
actually, Li Yue has been performing
really well recently.

36:16.550 --> 36:17.400
Don't be discouraged.

36:17.400 --> 36:18.800
Just fix the issues, and you'll be fine.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.000
What issues do I have?

36:20.710 --> 36:22.030
Well...

36:22.230 --> 36:24.360
sometimes you try too hard to look cool.

36:24.360 --> 36:27.290
You should try to
get into the character's mind more.

36:27.440 --> 36:29.630
For example, that line
at the gate of Qincheng—

36:29.630 --> 36:31.110
you could raise your pitch like this:

36:31.110 --> 36:32.510
"Welcome to Rongcheng."

36:33.440 --> 36:33.920
Right?

36:34.110 --> 36:35.370
Or lower it, like this:

36:35.630 --> 36:37.320
"Welcome to Rongcheng."

36:38.320 --> 36:39.320
What do you think?

36:44.170 --> 36:45.420
I think Group B's

36:45.570 --> 36:46.880
Qin Xiaoyi is just average.

36:46.880 --> 36:49.030
I mainly came for Group A's.

36:49.500 --> 36:51.250
The two portrayals are different.

36:51.250 --> 36:52.670
It's normal to have different preferences.

36:52.670 --> 36:54.450
Group A's Qin Xiaoyi is sharper,

36:54.450 --> 36:56.180
more perceptive, and precise.

36:56.400 --> 36:58.920
Those who like him find him very charming,

36:59.220 --> 37:02.570
but others find him
too dangerous and oppressive.

37:02.840 --> 37:05.150
Group B's Qin Xiaoyi is
sunnier and clearer.

37:05.150 --> 37:07.150
He's closer to a real-life person—

37:07.550 --> 37:09.110
he makes mistakes and feels fear.

37:09.110 --> 37:11.760
That makes his tragedy
easier for the audience to relate to.

37:11.760 --> 37:13.190
Perhaps he's not strong enough,

37:13.190 --> 37:15.990
but that kind of portrayal
isn't necessarily bad.

37:18.070 --> 37:19.530
We're clearly different.

37:19.920 --> 37:21.580
How can you say we're the same?

37:31.590 --> 37:32.650
You're here again.

37:32.670 --> 37:33.550
With a perk this good,

37:33.550 --> 37:35.010
it'd be a shame to waste it.

37:35.230 --> 37:37.490
Li Yue is playing in this session, right?

37:45.800 --> 37:46.720
Liu Rushi,

37:47.190 --> 37:48.320
a literary scholar.

37:48.710 --> 37:50.280
You must obtain the sapphire ring

37:49.540 --> 37:53.300
♪ What identity do you use
to enter and exit the role? ♪

37:50.280 --> 37:51.480
from Qin Xiaoyi

37:51.760 --> 37:53.760
in order to gain a chance to survive.

37:54.300 --> 37:58.620
♪ Reality and fantasy
are parallel and intertwine ♪

37:59.340 --> 38:03.210
♪ About the characters
and relationships of love ♪

38:03.360 --> 38:04.230
What are you doing here?

38:04.200 --> 38:08.910
♪  Like a multifaceted gem,
obsessed with each side ♪

38:06.320 --> 38:08.000
A player canceled at the last minute.

38:08.000 --> 38:09.060
I'm here to fill in.

38:09.140 --> 38:14.060
♪ Time and space interlace;
it's still you ♪

38:09.800 --> 38:11.070
Thank goodness.

38:11.320 --> 38:12.400
Otherwise, with you in the session,

38:12.400 --> 38:14.150
I'd end up dead again at your hands
without even knowing how.

38:14.090 --> 38:18.330
♪ Love overlaps in destiny ♪

38:16.630 --> 38:17.960
You'd better tell me

38:17.960 --> 38:20.510
that Gong Huaicong is
playing Qin Xiaoyi this session.

38:18.360 --> 38:22.920
♪ You made me change
my impromptu promise ♪

38:22.950 --> 38:27.790
♪ Two hearts slowly get closer
amidst sparks ♪

38:25.150 --> 38:26.840
Is it still possible to drop out now?

38:26.840 --> 38:27.840
No, it's too late.

38:27.840 --> 38:30.870
♪ I can feel my heart racing ♪

38:32.460 --> 38:34.850
♪ Ah ♪

38:33.960 --> 38:35.820
Everyone, welcome to Rongcheng.

38:35.820 --> 38:38.340
♪  The whole story revolves around you ♪

38:36.000 --> 38:37.400
The blizzard has blocked the roads.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.960
I apologize for the inconvenience,
distinguished guests,

38:38.960 --> 38:41.420
but you'll have to rest
in Rongcheng for now.

38:42.180 --> 38:44.090
♪ Ah ♪

38:44.920 --> 38:48.090
♪ To heal each other ♪

38:52.540 --> 38:55.530
♪ Ah ♪

38:56.150 --> 38:56.670
Li Yue.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.610
I'll play in this session.

39:00.320 --> 39:02.000
I've already spoken with Gong Huaicong.

39:02.000 --> 39:04.460
He said a scheduled player
couldn't make it,

39:04.550 --> 39:05.750
so you need to fill in.

39:06.840 --> 39:07.320
Okay.

39:07.840 --> 39:08.360
Thanks.

39:13.630 --> 39:15.190
The fill-in ticket I gave Hu Xiu

39:15.190 --> 39:17.250
is for the Sunday afternoon session.

39:23.490 --> 39:26.170
Murphy's Law never fails.

39:27.110 --> 39:28.380
The more you don't want to see him,

39:28.380 --> 39:29.510
the more he appears.

39:31.110 --> 39:33.970
Finally, there's someone
who can keep you in check.

39:38.000 --> 39:39.280
You don't want to see him that badly—

39:39.280 --> 39:41.810
you're afraid
you can't beat him, aren't you?

39:44.150 --> 39:44.840
What?

39:45.030 --> 39:46.630
You want to use him against me

39:46.630 --> 39:47.800
to get some payback?

39:48.280 --> 39:49.280
No, no, not at all.

39:49.670 --> 39:51.630
I came hoping we could team up.

39:53.000 --> 39:55.320
As long as I can get Qin Xiaoyi's ring,

39:55.440 --> 39:57.280
I can use its serial number

39:57.280 --> 39:59.810
to find out the mysterious backer
behind him.

40:01.670 --> 40:03.360
So you're trying to trick me

40:03.510 --> 40:05.190
into doing your dirty work?

40:05.670 --> 40:06.440
What are you talking about?

40:06.440 --> 40:07.840
I'm not tricking you.

40:08.190 --> 40:09.800
As long as we can get that ring,

40:09.800 --> 40:11.630
I'll do whatever you say.

40:23.840 --> 40:24.480
Hello, sir.

40:24.480 --> 40:25.280
Your coffee.

40:26.050 --> 40:27.260
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

40:28.590 --> 40:29.450
Commander Qin.

40:29.960 --> 40:31.120
I'm really sorry.
Let me help you clean up.

40:31.120 --> 40:31.730
It's fine.

40:33.320 --> 40:34.980
I came to give you urgent news.

40:35.280 --> 40:36.000
There are some people

40:36.000 --> 40:37.350
causing trouble over
at the Military Affairs Office.

40:37.350 --> 40:39.750
Please come with me quickly
to check it out.

40:43.480 --> 40:44.080
Miss,

40:44.630 --> 40:46.490
I believe this ring belongs to me.

40:51.400 --> 40:51.960
Yes.

40:52.510 --> 40:53.840
I was planning to take it

40:54.230 --> 40:55.630
and then return it to you.

41:05.340 --> 41:06.800
Thanks for your kindness.

41:15.670 --> 41:16.530
Commander Qin.

41:18.510 --> 41:19.710
I like your ring.

41:20.150 --> 41:21.510
I'll give you five gold bars for it.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.200
It's not for sale.

41:22.200 --> 41:23.630
If you won't sell it,
I'll just keep following you.

41:23.630 --> 41:25.490
I'll die without the ring anyway.

41:27.870 --> 41:29.330
Then follow me if you must.

41:29.370 --> 41:30.070
If you're with me,

41:30.070 --> 41:30.870
you won't die,

41:30.970 --> 41:32.190
with or without the ring.

41:32.190 --> 41:32.710
You!

42:32.880 --> 42:34.280
How about this, Miss Liu?

42:34.760 --> 42:36.530
If you buy me a stick of candied hawthorn,

42:36.530 --> 42:37.530
I'll give this ring...
